    "text": "<p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</